WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Meet TidyPro. One workspace for your cleaning business.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:25.000
This is your TidyPro dashboard. The moment you sign in, you can see the jobs running today, any quotes still open, how much money is outstanding, and how many customers you serve. Everything you need to know about your business, on one screen.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Every customer you clean for lives here. Filter by residential or commercial, search by name, email or phone, and export the whole list to Excel whenever you need it.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Open any customer and you get their full history in one place. Contact details, service addresses, and every quote and booking attached to them. If a customer has agreed to text reminders, you can record that consent here too.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Build a quote in under a minute and send it straight to your customer. TidyPro tracks the total you have quoted, the value customers have actually approved, and every quote by status — draft, sent, approved, or declined. Quotes follow up automatically, so you are never chasing anyone by hand.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:37.000
When a quote is approved, it becomes a booking in seconds. You can see the date, the time window, who is assigned, and exactly where your crew is headed. TidyPro also warns you before you double-book someone.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:56.000
This is the job board. Every visit, who it is assigned to, and where it stands — scheduled, in progress, completed, or canceled. Your cleaners see the same list on their phones, with checklists and before-and-after photos.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:13.000
Bill your customers without leaving TidyPro. See what you have invoiced, what you have collected, and what is still outstanding. Customers pay by card straight from their portal, and the money goes directly to your account.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:36.000
Here is what makes TidyPro different. Fourteen ready-made messages go out automatically — quote follow-ups, booking reminders, payment reminders, review requests — across both email and text. Edit the wording in your own words, or switch any message on and off. No per-message fees. Ever.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:48.000
TidyPro. Quotes, scheduling, crew, invoices, and customer messages in one workspace, with flat pricing and no per-user fees. Start your free fourteen-day trial today.